{#-
  BLOCK: signature — §06's `signature`. The agent who sent it, then the footer
  CAN-SPAM requires: why you are getting this, a working unsubscribe, and a
  valid postal address. Invariant across all eight report types, and the most
  legally loaded lines in the product.

  THE AGENT: a 56px disc (the photo, or initials in `on_primary` on the brand
  fill), the name, title · brand, and phone · email · website in `ink` (`primary_ink`,
  with `tr-brand` for dark mode).

  THE FOOTER, decided in Python and arriving pre-rendered (`postal_line`),
  because whose address appears is a compliance decision:
    the account set its own   "<brand> · <their address>"
    falling back              "Sent by TrendyReports · <ours> · on behalf of <agent>"
  Our name appears only in the second case (Design, 5th package; owner call
  2026-10-28: follow Design). A wrong address is a false statement, not a
  missing one, so ours is PLATFORM_POSTAL_ADDRESS from code — never the mock's.

  THE UNSUBSCRIBE LINK carries `tr-muted` AND IS NOT DECORATION. It sets its
  colour inline; without the class the dark-mode rule never reaches it, and the
  review measured it at 3.08:1 on the dark card — an opt-out that is not "clear
  and conspicuous". `#64748B` on white is 4.76:1.

  `unsubscribe_url` is the per-recipient sentinel `send.py` replaces; the link
  must stay an `href` on the path the unsubscribe gate follows
  (`/api/v1/email/unsubscribe`).
-#}
          <tr><td class="tr-pad tr-rule" style="padding:28px 28px 24px;border-top:1px solid #ECEAE3;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse:collapse;"><tr>
            <td width="56" valign="top" style="width:56px;">{% if photo_url %}<img src="{{ photo_url }}" alt="{{ agent_name }}" width="56" height="56" style="display:block;width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:28px;border:0;">{% else %}<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td width="56" height="56" align="center" valign="middle" bgcolor="{{ primary }}" style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:28px;background:{{ primary }};font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:{{ on_primary }};">{{ initials }}</td></tr></table>{% endif %}</td>
            <td valign="middle" style="padding-left:16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
              <div class="tr-ink" style="font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#0F172A;">{{ agent_name }}</div>
              {% if title_line %}<div class="tr-muted" style="margin-top:2px;font-size:13px;color:#64748B;">{{ title_line }}</div>{% endif %}
              {% if phone or email or website_url %}<div style="margin-top:4px;font-size:13px;">{% if phone %}{% if phone_href %}<a href="{{ phone_href }}" class="tr-brand" style="color:{{ ink }};text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">{{ phone }}</a>{% else %}<span class="tr-brand" style="color:{{ ink }};font-weight:600;">{{ phone }}</span>{% endif %}{% endif %}{% if phone and email %}<span class="tr-muted" style="color:#64748B;"> · </span>{% endif %}{% if email %}<a href="mailto:{{ email }}" class="tr-brand" style="color:{{ ink }};text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">{{ email }}</a>{% endif %}{% if website_url %}{% if phone or email %}<span class="tr-muted" style="color:#64748B;"> · </span>{% endif %}<a href="{{ website_url }}" class="tr-brand" style="color:{{ ink }};text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">{{ website_label }}</a>{% endif %}</div>{% endif %}
            </td>
          </tr></table></td></tr>
          <tr><td class="tr-pad" style="padding:0 28px 28px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
            <p class="tr-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#64748B;">{{ reason_line }} <a href="{{ unsubscribe_url }}" class="tr-muted" style="color:#64748B;text-decoration:underline;">Unsubscribe</a> — no sign-in needed.</p>
            <p class="tr-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#64748B;">{{ postal_line }}</p>
            <p class="tr-muted" style="margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#64748B;">{{ data_line }}</p>
          </td></tr>
